{"id":"cc503519ccb708ff","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-oracle-graph-basis.md","title":"极小 oracle 图的唯一 use 与生成性","display":"thm-oracle-graph-basis — 极小 oracle 图的唯一 use 与生成性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-oracle-graph-basis","aliases":["20-thm-oracle-graph-basis"],"display":"thm-oracle-graph-basis — 极小 oracle 图的唯一 use 与生成性","chapter":"3","section":"3.3.1–3.3.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorems 3.3.3, 3.3.5, 3.3.8","source_printed_pages":[55,56],"source_pdf_pages":[91,92],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-minimal-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-oracle-graph-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-oracle-graph-basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-oracle-graph-basis — 极小 oracle 图的唯一 use 与生成性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3.1–3.3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorems 3.3.3, 3.3.5, 3.3.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span><span>56</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91</span><span>92</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7d3b5746093d796\" href=\"?note=c7d3b5746093d796\" title=\"20-df-oracle-minimal-graph\">20-df-oracle-minimal-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7d3b5746093d796\" href=\"?note=c7d3b5746093d796\" title=\"20-df-oracle-minimal-graph\">20-df-oracle-minimal-graph</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}oracle-graph-basis}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\sigma,\\tau\\in H_{e,x}\\land\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\sigma=\\tau,\\\\\n(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\ [(\\tau,x,y)\\in F_e],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow\\exists!\\sigma\\preceq A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in F_e].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}oracle-graph-basis}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\sigma,\\tau\\in H_{e,x}\\land\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\sigma=\\tau,\\\\\n(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\ [(\\tau,x,y)\\in F_e],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow\\exists!\\sigma\\preceq A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in F_e].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若两个极小串可比较，较短串上的停止历史也在较长串上原样停止，两次计算的 use 相同，因而两串长度相同。任一停止串可以截到其实际 use，得到极小串；其每个延伸保留同一停止历史。这同时证明生成性及实际 oracle 上的唯一性。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorems 3.3.3, 3.3.5, 3.3.8；印刷页 55, 56；PDF 第 91, 92 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-minimal-graph","status":"resolved","id":"c7d3b5746093d796","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-minimal-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-minimal-graph","status":"resolved","id":"c7d3b5746093d796","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-minimal-graph]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}oracle-graph-basis}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\sigma,\\tau\\in H_{e,x}\\land\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\sigma=\\tau,\\\\\n(\\sigma,x,y)\\in G_e\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\preceq\\sigma\\ [(\\tau,x,y)\\in F_e],\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\Rightarrow\\exists!\\sigma\\preceq A\\ [(\\sigma,x,y)\\in F_e].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1468,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-oracle-graph-basis]] — 章 3；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-oracle-graph-basis]]"}],"outgoing":["c7d3b5746093d796"]}